      "description": "Yellow form action, shown enabled and disabled; whitespace-only drafts remain disabled.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-submit-states\"><button class=\"ds-submit\" type=\"button\">Leave a note <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-submit\" type=\"button\" disabled>Leave a note <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-submit-states{display:grid;gap:8px}.ds-submit{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;min-height:38px;padding:8px 12px;font:500 12px Onest,sans-serif;border:0;border-radius:5px;color:var(--ink,#292c31);background:var(--brand,#e2f276);cursor:pointer}.ds-submit svg{width:16px;height:16px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.7;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;flex-shrink:0;}.ds-submit:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#627523);outline-offset:5px;}.ds-submit:disabled{cursor:default;opacity:.5}"
