      "description": "The Focus mark and DM Sans wordmark share an inline row with underlining text links.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a class=\"ds-wordmark\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"Rebyu home\"><svg class=\"ds-nav-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\"><g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M28 12H15a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v13\"/><path d=\"M36 52h13a3 3 0 0 0 3-3V36\"/></g><circle cx=\"32\" cy=\"32\" r=\"5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>rebyu</a><div class=\"ds-nav-links\"><a href=\"#demo\">Try it</a><a href=\"#install\">Get started</a><a href=\"https://github.com/carere/rebyu\">GitHub <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12\"/></svg></a></div></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;min-height:80px;background:var(--brand,#e2f276);color:var(--ink,#292c31);border-bottom:1px solid #292c312b;font-family:Onest,sans-serif}.ds-wordmark{display:inline-flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;font:650 30px \"DM Sans\",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.035em;text-decoration:none;color:inherit}.ds-nav-mark{width:32px;height:32px;flex-shrink:0}.ds-nav-links{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:32px;font-size:14px}.ds-nav-links a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;text-underline-offset:4px}.ds-nav-links svg{width:13px;height:13px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.7;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;flex-shrink:0;}.ds-nav-links a:hover{text-decoration:underline}.ds-nav a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#627523);outline-offset:5px;}@media(max-width:700px){.ds-nav{min-height:76px;gap:16px}.ds-wordmark{font-size:26px;gap:4px}.ds-nav-mark{width:28px;height:28px}.ds-nav-links{gap:16px;font-size:12px}}@media(max-width:370px){.ds-nav-links{gap:11px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Review comment",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "comment",
      "description": "A plain bordered note with muted attribution and an underlined Resolve control.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-comment\"><p>Could this heading have a little more breathing room?</p><footer><span>Sam · example comment</span><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Resolve example comment 1\">Resolve</button></footer></article>",
      "css": ".ds-comment{font:12px Onest,sans-serif;color:var(--ink,#292c31);padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--line,#dfe3d8);border-radius:6px;background:#fff}.ds-comment p{margin:0;line-height:1.6;overflow-wrap:anywhere;white-space:pre-wrap}.ds-comment footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:10px;font-size:10px;color:var(--muted,#62685b)}.ds-comment button{border:0;padding:3px 0;background:transparent;color:var(--muted,#62685b);font:10px Onest,sans-serif;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;cursor:pointer}.ds-comment button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#627523);outline-offset:5px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Selected heading and pin",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "review-heading",
      "description": "The selected sample heading shows the review outline and an open-note number.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-heading-preview\"><h2 class=\"ds-sample-heading\"><button class=\"ds-review-heading\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Review the sample heading\" aria-pressed=\"true\" data-pin=\"1\">A small place<br>for good ideas.</button></h2></div>",
      "css": ".ds-heading-preview{padding:24px}.ds-sample-heading{margin:0;font:550 clamp(32px,3.3vw,46px)/1.12 Onest,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.035em;color:var(--ink,#292c31)}.ds-review-heading{position:relative;border:0;text-align:left;color:inherit;padding:5px 8px 7px;margin-left:-8px;font:inherit;line-height:inherit;letter-spacing:inherit;background:transparent;cursor:pointer}.ds-review-heading:hover,.ds-review-heading[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{outline:1.5px solid #7e9236;outline-offset:5px}.ds-review-heading[data-pin]::after{content:attr(data-pin);position:absolute;right:-15px;top:-17px;width:23px;height:23px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--brand,#e2f276);color:var(--ink,#292c31);display:grid;place-items:center;font:500 11px Onest,sans-serif;letter-spacing:normal;z-index:1}.ds-review-heading:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#627523);outline-offset:5px;}@media(max-width:700px){.ds-sample-heading{font-size:clamp(32px,7vw,42px)}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sample note target",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "sample-note",
      "description": "The sample note is an open, top-ruled review target, with the same hover and selection outline.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-sample-note\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Review the sample note card\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"ds-sample-note-title\">Leave room for the unexpected.</span><span class=\"ds-sample-note-copy\">The best ideas usually start as something smaller.</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-sample-note{box-sizing:border-box;position:relative;display:grid;gap:6px;width:100%;padding:17px 32px 16px 0;border:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line,#dfe3d8);background:transparent;text-align:left;color:var(--ink,#292c31);font-family:Onest,sans-serif;cursor:pointer}.ds-sample-note-title{font-size:15px;font-weight:550;letter-spacing:-.02em}.ds-sample-note-copy{font-size:11px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--muted,#62685b)}.ds-sample-note svg{position:absolute;right:1px;top:18px;width:16px;height:16px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.7;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;flex-shrink:0;}.ds-sample-note:hover,.ds-sample-note[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{outline:1.5px solid #7e9236;outline-offset:5px}.ds-sample-note:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#627523);outline-offset:5px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Installation code panel",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "install-code",
      "description": "A flat white panel groups the command, configuration, copy controls, and production-exclusion footnote.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-code-panel\" aria-label=\"Installation example\"><div class=\"ds-code-label\"><span>Install after the first npm release</span><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy install command\">Copy</button></div><pre><code>npm install -D vite-plugin-rebyu</code></pre><div class=\"ds-code-label ds-code-config\"><span>vite.config.ts</span><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy Vite configuration\">Copy</button></div><pre><code><span class=\"ds-syntax-muted\">import</span> { defineConfig } <span class=\"ds-syntax-muted\">from</span> <span class=\"ds-syntax-string\">\"vite\"</span>;\n<span class=\"ds-syntax-muted\">import</span> rebyu <span class=\"ds-syntax-muted\">from</span> <span class=\"ds-syntax-string\">\"vite-plugin-rebyu\"</span>;\n\n<span class=\"ds-syntax-muted\">export default</span> defineConfig({\n  plugins: [rebyu()],\n});</code></pre><p class=\"ds-code-footnote\">Development only. Rebyu is excluded from production builds.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-code-panel{min-width:0;background:#fff;color:var(--ink,#292c31);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;font-family:Onest,sans-serif}.ds-code-label{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;min-height:48px;padding:13px 22px;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted,#62685b)}.ds-code-label button{background:transparent;border:0;color:var(--ink,#292c31);font:11px Onest,sans-serif;padding:3px 0;min-width:40px;text-align:right;cursor:pointer}.ds-code-label button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#627523);outline-offset:5px;}.ds-code-panel pre{margin:0;padding:2px 22px 23px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.9;overflow-x:auto;scrollbar-color:#b7c19b transparent}.ds-code-panel code{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace}.ds-code-config{border-top:1px solid var(--line,#dfe3d8)}.ds-syntax-muted{color:#667454}.ds-syntax-string{color:#536b15}.ds-code-footnote{margin:0;font-size:10px;line-height:1.7;padding:14px 22px;border-top:1px solid var(--line,#dfe3d8);color:var(--muted,#62685b)}@media(max-width:700px){.ds-code-panel pre{font-size:10px;padding-inline:16px}.ds-code-label,.ds-code-footnote{padding-inline:16px}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Working review sheet",
    "overview": "This documents the implemented working proposal, not a final website direction\napproved by the user. The approved commitments are the Focus mark, yellow and ink\nidentity, a code-first working page, and an interactive, disposable browser-local\nexample. The name above describes the current proposal rather than a separately\napproved creative concept.\n\nThe current site uses broad light surfaces, close-set sans-serif headings, thin\ndividers, and compact controls. Numbered pins and an adjacent conversation make\nthe review mechanism visible. This website system is independent of the plugin's\nwidget design system; the home composition remains in\n[the surface brief](.impeccable/surfaces/home.md).",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Approved Focus identity in yellow and ink.",
      "Flat light surfaces separated by tone and fine rules.",
      "Onest content typography with a DM Sans wordmark.",
      "Visible selection outlines, numbered pins, and compact note controls."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Focus Identity Rule",
        "body": "Keep the approved Focus mark and yellow-and-ink identity.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Flat Surface Rule",
        "body": "Use tone, borders, and outlines for the current proposal's depth.",
        "section": "elevation"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Context Rule",
        "body": "Show the selected target with an outline and attach its open-note number to the target.",
        "section": "components"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do reuse the approved Focus artwork and the yellow-and-ink identity.",
      "Do preserve visible keyboard focus and reduced-motion behavior.",
      "Do keep selection outlines and numbered pins tied to the review target.",
      "Do use the existing flat surfaces and compact control corners."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't present this working proposal as a user-approved final visual direction.",
      "Don't treat the website's tokens as the plugin widget's design system.",
      "Don't add shadows or animated lifting to the current component vocabulary.",
      "Don't imply that the illustrative notes persist or are shared with other visitors."
    ]
  }
}
